config DRM_CHARLOTTE_DPU
	tristate "Charlotte DPU v700 firmware-handoff KMS"
	depends on DRM && OF && ARM64 && I2C
	select DRM_GEM_DMA_HELPER
	select DRM_KMS_HELPER
	help
	  Native atomic KMS and DMA-buffer scanout for the DPU v700 on
	  Huawei TGR-W00. Retains the firmware's DSI/DSC/panel initialization.
	  Only the existing 1840x2800 scanout mode is supported initially.
	  The probe_only=1 parameter inspects the handoff without register
	  writes, interrupts or KMS takeover. Explicit debugfs diagnostics are
	  bounded and restore the interrupt mask. Build this driver into the
	  kernel on TGR: loadable module execution is not functional there yet.
